      "values:originalText": "(3) Subsection (1) applies to conduct specified in any of\nparagraphs (2)(a) to (h) only if the conduct is engaged in:\n\n(a) with the intention of advancing a political, religious or\nideological cause; and\n\n(b) with the intention of:\n\n(i) coercing, or influencing by intimidation, the\ngovernment of the Commonwealth or a State, Territory\nor foreign country, or of part of a State, Territory or\nforeign country; or\n\n(ii) intimidating the public or a section of the public.",
