          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-33aa-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e41a89fc132f1141ebb051ad5ff009df635412b3b556af6b0d0c97b9a9d3f308",
      "skos:note": "Engaging in conduct with intention to support a declared terrorist organisation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015#sch-1-sec-33aa-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "33AA(4) Renunciation by conduct",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "(4) A person is taken to have engaged in conduct with an intention\nreferred to in subsection (3) if, when the person engaged in the\nconduct, the person was:\n\n(a) a member of a declared terrorist organisation (see\nsection 35AA); or\n\n(b) acting on instruction of, or in cooperation with, a declared\nterrorist organisation."
    },
