      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(7) This section does not apply in relation to conduct by a person\nunless:\n\n(a) the person was not in Australia when the person engaged in\nthe conduct; or\n\n(b) the person left Australia after engaging in the conduct and, at\nthe time that the person left Australia, the person had not\nbeen tried for any offence related to the conduct.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) This section does not apply in relation to conduct by a person\nunless:\n\n(a) the person was not in Australia when the person engaged in\nthe conduct; or\n\n(b) the person left Australia after engaging in the conduct and, at\nthe time that the person left Australia, the person had not\nbeen tried for any offence related to the conduct.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-101"
      },
