      "cml:premiseText": "(14) At any time after a person has renounced his or her citizenship under this section, the Minister may make a determination to:",
      "cml:conclusionText": "rescind notice or exempt person from section's effect."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-101-ss-14-logic-deontic-2",
