        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(14) At any time after a person has renounced his or her citizenship under this section, the Minister may make a determination to:",
      "cml:conclusionText": "exempt person from the effect of this section in relation to matters that were the basis for the notice, or in relation to matters that would have been the basis for giving a notice in respect of the person under paragraph (10)(a), but for the operation of subsection (12)."
    },
