      "values:originalText": "(15) The Minister does not have a duty to consider whether to exercise\nthe power under subsection (14) in respect of any person, whether\nthe Minister is requested to do so by the person who has renounced\nhis or her citizenship under this section, or by any other person, or\nin any other circumstances.",
