      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(16) To avoid doubt, in deciding whether to consider exercising the\npower in subsection (14), the Minister is not required to have\nregard to any of the matters referred to in subsection (17).",
      "skos:definition": "(16) To avoid doubt, in deciding whether to consider exercising the\npower in subsection (14), the Minister is not required to have\nregard to any of the matters referred to in subsection (17).",
      "values:partOf": {
