      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(18) If the Minister makes a determination under subsection (14), the\nMinister must cause to be laid before each House of the\nParliament, within 15 sitting days of that House after the Minister\nmakes the determination, a statement that:\n\n(a) sets out the determination; and\n\n(b) sets out the reasons for the determination, referring in\nparticular to the Minister’s reasons in relation to the matters\nset out in subsection (17).",
      "skos:definition": "(18) If the Minister makes a determination under subsection (14), the\nMinister must cause to be laid before each House of the\nParliament, within 15 sitting days of that House after the Minister\nmakes the determination, a statement that:\n\n(a) sets out the determination; and\n\n(b) sets out the reasons for the determination, referring in\nparticular to the Minister’s reasons in relation to the matters\nset out in subsection (17).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-101"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-101-ss-18-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-101-ss-18-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ed14471643596fdfce62f70a66e31a2ddf920498e206915b28b38bad0b14d693",
      "skos:note": "Minister must provide statement to Parliament within 15 days of determination.",
      "dc:description": "yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015#sch-1-sec-101-ss-18",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "101(18) 2, 102.2, 102.4, 103.1 and 103.2 and Division 119 of the",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(18) If the Minister makes a determination under subsection (14), the\nMinister must cause to be laid before each House of the\nParliament, within 15 sitting days of that House after the Minister\nmakes the determination, a statement that:\n\n(a) sets out the determination; and\n\n(b) sets out the reasons for the determination, referring in\nparticular to the Minister’s reasons in relation to the matters\nset out in subsection (17)."
    },
