      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(21) Section 47 applies to a decision by the Minister to make, or not\nmake, a determination under subsection (14), but does not apply to\nany other decision of the Minister under this section (including any\ndecision whether to consider exercising the power in\nsubsection (14) to make a determination).\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166\n\nSchedule 1  Main amendments\n\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Allegiance to Australia) Act 2015\nNo. 166, 2015",
      "skos:definition": "(21) Section 47 applies to a decision by the Minister to make, or not\nmake, a determination under subsection (14), but does not apply to\nany other decision of the Minister under this section (including any\ndecision whether to consider exercising the power in\nsubsection (14) to make a determination).\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166\n\nSchedule 1  Main amendments\n\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Allegiance to Australia) Act 2015\nNo. 166, 2015",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-101"
      },
