      "cml:premiseText": "A declaration under section 35AA is disallowed by either House of Parliament if the person's citizenship would not have ceased under this section.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The citizenship diffuses to the person if they do not cease under this section."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-4",
