      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of subparagraph (1)(b)(ii) and without limitation,\na person is not in the service of a declared terrorist organisation to\nthe extent that:\n\n(a) the person’s actions are unintentional; or\n\n(b) the person is acting under duress or force; or\n\n(c) the person is providing neutral and independent humanitarian\nassistance.\nMinister to give notice",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of subparagraph (1)(b)(ii) and without limitation,\na person is not in the service of a declared terrorist organisation to\nthe extent that:\n\n(a) the person’s actions are unintentional; or\n\n(b) the person is acting under duress or force; or\n\n(c) the person is providing neutral and independent humanitarian\nassistance.\nMinister to give notice",
      "values:partOf": {
