      "values:originalText": "(6) A notice under paragraph (5)(a) must set out:\n\n(a) the matters required by section 35B; and\n\n(b) the person’s rights of review.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) A notice under paragraph (5)(a) must set out:\n\n(a) the matters required by section 35B; and\n\n(b) the person’s rights of review.",
      "values:partOf": {
