      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "35(10) Service outside Australia in armed forces of an enemy country or",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "(10) The Minister does not have a duty to consider whether to exercise\nthe power under subsection (9) in respect of any person, whether\nthe Minister is requested to do so by the person who has ceased to\nbe a citizen under this section, or by any other person, or in any\nother circumstances."
    },
