      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(13) If the Minister makes a determination under subsection (9), the\nMinister must cause to be laid before each House of the\nParliament, within 15 sitting days of that House after the Minister\nmakes the determination, a statement that:\n\n(a) sets out the determination; and\n\n(b) sets out the reasons for the determination, referring in\nparticular to the Minister’s reasons in relation to the matters\nset out in subsection (12).",
      "skos:definition": "(13) If the Minister makes a determination under subsection (9), the\nMinister must cause to be laid before each House of the\nParliament, within 15 sitting days of that House after the Minister\nmakes the determination, a statement that:\n\n(a) sets out the determination; and\n\n(b) sets out the reasons for the determination, referring in\nparticular to the Minister’s reasons in relation to the matters\nset out in subsection (12).",
      "values:partOf": {
