      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(15) The powers of the Minister under this section may only be\nexercised by the Minister personally.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166\n\nSchedule 1  Main amendments\n\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Allegiance to Australia) Act 2015\nNo. 166, 2015",
      "skos:definition": "(15) The powers of the Minister under this section may only be\nexercised by the Minister personally.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166\n\nSchedule 1  Main amendments\n\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Allegiance to Australia) Act 2015\nNo. 166, 2015",
      "values:partOf": {
