      "skos:note": "Review declaration made under subsection (1) as soon as possible after declaration is made."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015#sch-1-sec-35aa-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "35AA(4) Declared terrorist organisation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Parliamentary Joint Committee on Intelligence and Security\nmay:\n\n(a) review a declaration made under subsection (1) as soon as\npossible after the declaration is made; and\n\n(b) report the Committee’s comments and recommendations to\neach House of the Parliament before the end of the period\nduring which the House may disallow the declaration."
    },
