      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35a-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": ">=",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Describes the temporal relationship between being born and becoming an Australian citizen",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "A person who became an Australian citizen upon the person’s birth",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person was born before becoming an Australian citizen"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35a-ss-3-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "implies",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Implies that being born in Australia is necessary for citizenship",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "A person who became an Australian citizen upon the person’s birth",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person was born in Australia"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "35A(4) Conviction for terrorism offences and certain other offences",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015#sch-1-sec-35a-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purpose of paragraph (1)(b):\n\n(a) the reference to being sentenced to a period of imprisonment\ndoes not include a suspended sentence; and\n\n(b) if a single sentence of imprisonment is imposed in respect of\nboth an offence against a provision mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(a) and in respect of one or more other offences,\nthen:\n\n(i) if it is clear that only a particular part of the total period\nof imprisonment relates to the offence against the\nprovision mentioned in paragraph (1)(a)—the person is\ntaken to have been sentenced to imprisonment in respect\nof that offence for that part of the total period of\nimprisonment; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166\n\nSchedule 1  Main amendments\n\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Allegiance to Australia) Act 2015\nNo. 166, 2015\n\n(ii) if subparagraph (i) does not apply—the person is taken\nto have been sentenced to imprisonment in respect of\nthe offence against the provision mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(a) for the whole of the total period of\nimprisonment.\nMinister to give notice",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purpose of paragraph (1)(b):\n\n(a) the reference to being sentenced to a period of imprisonment\ndoes not include a suspended sentence; and\n\n(b) if a single sentence of imprisonment is imposed in respect of\nboth an offence against a provision mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(a) and in respect of one or more other offences,\nthen:\n\n(i) if it is clear that only a particular part of the total period\nof imprisonment relates to the offence against the\nprovision mentioned in paragraph (1)(a)—the person is\ntaken to have been sentenced to imprisonment in respect\nof that offence for that part of the total period of\nimprisonment; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166\n\nSchedule 1  Main amendments\n\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Allegiance to Australia) Act 2015\nNo. 166, 2015\n\n(ii) if subparagraph (i) does not apply—the person is taken\nto have been sentenced to imprisonment in respect of\nthe offence against the provision mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(a) for the whole of the total period of\nimprisonment.\nMinister to give notice",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35a-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35a-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35a-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35a-ss-4-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35a-ss-4-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8d3552cf1e051ee92e921eaa7409589faa6ab2cca41c6c13305203d0f8823f86",
      "skos:note": "A person is taken to have been sentenced to imprisonment in respect of the offence against the provision mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) for that part of the total period of imprisonment if it is clear that only a particular part of the total period relates to the offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015#sch-1-sec-35a-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "35A(4) Conviction for terrorism offences and certain other offences",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purpose of paragraph (1)(b):\n\n(a) the reference to being sentenced to a period of imprisonment\ndoes not include a suspended sentence; and\n\n(b) if a single sentence of imprisonment is imposed in respect of\nboth an offence against a provision mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(a) and in respect of one or more other offences,\nthen:\n\n(i) if it is clear that only a particular part of the total period\nof imprisonment relates to the offence against the\nprovision mentioned in paragraph (1)(a)—the person is\ntaken to have been sentenced to imprisonment in respect\nof that offence for that part of the total period of\nimprisonment; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166\n\nSchedule 1  Main amendments\n\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Allegiance to Australia) Act 2015\nNo. 166, 2015\n\n(ii) if subparagraph (i) does not apply—the person is taken\nto have been sentenced to imprisonment in respect of\nthe offence against the provision mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(a) for the whole of the total period of\nimprisonment.\nMinister to give notice"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35a-ss-4-norm",
