    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35a-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "35A(7) Conviction for terrorism offences and certain other offences",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015#sch-1-sec-35a-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "(7) The Minister may determine in writing that a notice under\nparagraph (5)(a) should not be given to a person if the Minister is\nsatisfied that giving the notice could prejudice the security, defence\nor international relations of Australia, or Australian law\nenforcement operations. The Minister must consider whether to\nrevoke the determination:\n\n(a) no later than 6 months after making it; and\n\n(b) at least every 6 months thereafter until 5 years have passed\nsince the determination was made.\nMinister must revoke determination if conviction overturned",
      "skos:definition": "(7) The Minister may determine in writing that a notice under\nparagraph (5)(a) should not be given to a person if the Minister is\nsatisfied that giving the notice could prejudice the security, defence\nor international relations of Australia, or Australian law\nenforcement operations. The Minister must consider whether to\nrevoke the determination:\n\n(a) no later than 6 months after making it; and\n\n(b) at least every 6 months thereafter until 5 years have passed\nsince the determination was made.\nMinister must revoke determination if conviction overturned",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-35a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
