    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-36a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "36A No resumption of citizenship if citizenship ceases under",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015#sch-1-sec-36a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf, p.22",
      "values:originalText": "section 33AA, 35 or 35A\n\nIf under section 33AA, 35 or 35A a person ceases to be an\nAustralian citizen, then Divisions 1 and 2 of this Part do not apply\nin relation to the person on and after the time of that cessation.\nNote:\nThe effect of this section is that (subject to subsections 33AA(14) and\n(24), 35(9) and (19) and 35A(8) and (9)) the person can never become\nan Australian citizen again.",
      "skos:definition": "section 33AA, 35 or 35A\n\nIf under section 33AA, 35 or 35A a person ceases to be an\nAustralian citizen, then Divisions 1 and 2 of this Part do not apply\nin relation to the person on and after the time of that cessation.\nNote:\nThe effect of this section is that (subject to subsections 33AA(14) and\n(24), 35(9) and (19) and 35A(8) and (9)) the person can never become\nan Australian citizen again.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-36a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-1-sec-36a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5d11705df2d0a2c809032fd0f7fa3a6d417367bb8648bd16945d823fb91bb8fd",
      "skos:note": "No resumption of citizenship if citizenship ceases under section 33AA, 35 or 35A."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015#sch-1-sec-36a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "36A No resumption of citizenship if citizenship ceases under",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 22,
      "values:originalText": "section 33AA, 35 or 35A\n\nIf under section 33AA, 35 or 35A a person ceases to be an\nAustralian citizen, then Divisions 1 and 2 of this Part do not apply\nin relation to the person on and after the time of that cessation.\nNote:\nThe effect of this section is that (subject to subsections 33AA(14) and\n(24), 35(9) and (19) and 35A(8) and (9)) the person can never become\nan Australian citizen again."
    },
    {
