      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of this section, reporting period means:\n\n(a) the period of 6 months beginning on the day this section\ncommences; and\n\n(b) each subsequent 6-month period.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of this section, reporting period means:\n\n(a) the period of 6 months beginning on the day this section\ncommences; and\n\n(b) each subsequent 6-month period.",
