      "values:originalText": "(5) The briefing must include details of the following:\n\n(a) for an event mentioned in paragraph (1)(a):\n\n(i) the matters that are the basis for the notice; and\n\n(ii) whether the Minister has rescinded the notice and\nexempted the person to whom the notice related from\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166\n\nSchedule 2  Other amendments\n\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Allegiance to Australia) Act 2015\nNo. 166, 2015\n\nthe effect of the section in relation to the matters that\nwere the basis for the notice;\n\n(b) for an event mentioned in paragraph (1)(b):\n\n(i) the matters that are the basis for the determination under\nsubsection 35A(1) to which the notice relates;\n\n(ii) whether the Minister has revoked under\nsubsection 35A(8) the determination to which the notice\nrelates; and\n\n(c) for an event mentioned in paragraph (1)(c)—the matters that\nare the basis for the determination.\nIndependent National Security Legislation Monitor Act 2010",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The briefing must include details of the following:\n\n(a) for an event mentioned in paragraph (1)(a):\n\n(i) the matters that are the basis for the notice; and\n\n(ii) whether the Minister has rescinded the notice and\nexempted the person to whom the notice related from\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166\n\nSchedule 2  Other amendments\n\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Allegiance to Australia) Act 2015\nNo. 166, 2015\n\nthe effect of the section in relation to the matters that\nwere the basis for the notice;\n\n(b) for an event mentioned in paragraph (1)(b):\n\n(i) the matters that are the basis for the determination under\nsubsection 35A(1) to which the notice relates;\n\n(ii) whether the Minister has revoked under\nsubsection 35A(8) the determination to which the notice\nrelates; and\n\n(c) for an event mentioned in paragraph (1)(c)—the matters that\nare the basis for the determination.\nIndependent National Security Legislation Monitor Act 2010",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-2-sec-51c"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-2-sec-51c-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-2-sec-51c-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0b63c6522d69d19024c42474329f7d09cdc628f7d7a381c3a8f10f129a3103b3",
      "skos:note": "Must provide details of events and determinations related to notices.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015#sch-2-sec-51c-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "51C(5) Briefing of Parliamentary Joint Committee on Intelligence and",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 25,
      "values:originalText": "(5) The briefing must include details of the following:\n\n(a) for an event mentioned in paragraph (1)(a):\n\n(i) the matters that are the basis for the notice; and\n\n(ii) whether the Minister has rescinded the notice and\nexempted the person to whom the notice related from\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166\n\nSchedule 2  Other amendments\n\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment (Allegiance to Australia) Act 2015\nNo. 166, 2015\n\nthe effect of the section in relation to the matters that\nwere the basis for the notice;\n\n(b) for an event mentioned in paragraph (1)(b):\n\n(i) the matters that are the basis for the determination under\nsubsection 35A(1) to which the notice relates;\n\n(ii) whether the Minister has revoked under\nsubsection 35A(8) the determination to which the notice\nrelates; and\n\n(c) for an event mentioned in paragraph (1)(c)—the matters that\nare the basis for the determination.\nIndependent National Security Legislation Monitor Act 2010"
    },
