      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015.pdf, p.27",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments of the Independent National Security Legislation\nMonitor Act 2010 and the Intelligence Services Act 2001 made by this\nSchedule apply in relation to sections 33AA, 35 and 35A of the\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007 as in force on and after the\ncommencement of this Act.\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 24 June 2015\nSenate on 30 November 2015]\n\n(125/15)\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments of the Independent National Security Legislation\nMonitor Act 2010 and the Intelligence Services Act 2001 made by this\nSchedule apply in relation to sections 33AA, 35 and 35A of the\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007 as in force on and after the\ncommencement of this Act.\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 24 June 2015\nSenate on 30 November 2015]\n\n(125/15)\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015-sch-2-sec-9-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "09062ae7397882804ac1ce4e654a45da20783713b512a9a090b5c57d211439df",
      "skos:note": "Application of amendments"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-allegiance-to-australia-act-2015#sch-2-sec-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9 Application of amendments",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 27,
      "values:originalText": "The amendments of the Independent National Security Legislation\nMonitor Act 2010 and the Intelligence Services Act 2001 made by this\nSchedule apply in relation to sections 33AA, 35 and 35A of the\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007 as in force on and after the\ncommencement of this Act.\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 24 June 2015\nSenate on 30 November 2015]\n\n(125/15)\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00166"
    },
